Package: libhyprlang-unstable-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libhyprlang2-unstable (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: libhyprlang-dev
Conflicts: libhyprlang-dev
Provides: libhyprlang-dev (= 0.6.8)
Description: Configuration language for linux applications.
 The hypr configuration language is an extremely efficient, yet easy to work with, configuration language for linux applications.
 It's user-friendly, easy to grasp, and easy to implement.
 This package includes the build-headers for using hyprlang-unstable in your own project.

